---
// Lim, Zohren & Roberts, "Enhancing Time Series Momentum Strategies Using Deep Neural Networks" (2019):
// Exhibit 3 (rescaled to target volatility), Sharpe ratio column, 88 futures contracts, backtest 1995-2015, before costs.
//   Linear: MSE-trained 1.211, Sharpe-trained 1.496
//   MLP:    MSE-trained 1.017, Sharpe-trained 2.017
//   LSTM:   MSE-trained 0.791, Sharpe-trained 2.907
//   Long-only reference 0.759
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900;
const H = 424;
const x0 = 450, y0 = 330, ph = 220; // plot area bottom-left, height for 3.0
const sy = ph / 3;
const groups = [
  { en: 'Linear', vi: 'Tuyến tính', mse: 1.211, sh: 1.496 },
  { en: 'MLP', vi: 'MLP', mse: 1.017, sh: 2.017 },
  { en: 'LSTM', vi: 'LSTM', mse: 0.791, sh: 2.907 },
];
const gw = 135;
---
<figure class="atp14-sl">
  <div class="atp14-sl-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Same models, different loss. Left: the two loss formulas, mean squared error on forecasts and minus the annualised Sharpe ratio of the trading rule. Right: backtest Sharpe ratios on 88 futures, 1995 to 2015, before costs. Linear: 1.211 trained on MSE, 1.496 on Sharpe. MLP: 1.017 and 2.017. LSTM: 0.791 and 2.907. A long-only position scored 0.759.">
    <text x="20" y="26" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Same network, different loss, different strategy</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Cùng mạng, khác hàm loss, ra chiến lược khác</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="20" y="46" class="sub">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Lim, Zohren and Roberts: 88 futures contracts, 1995 to 2015, before transaction costs.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Lim, Zohren và Roberts: 88 hợp đồng tương lai, 1995 đến 2015, chưa tính phí giao dịch.</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="20" y="70" width="390" height="108" rx="6" class="panel" />
    <text x="34" y="94" class="t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Loss 1: mean squared error</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Loss 1: sai số bình phương</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="34" y="118" class="f">mean( (forecast − return)² )</text>
    <text x="34" y="144" class="sub">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Rewards being close to every return.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Thưởng cho việc gần mọi mức lợi suất.</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="20" y="192" width="390" height="108" rx="6" class="panel good" />
    <text x="34" y="216" class="t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Loss 2: Sharpe loss</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Loss 2: Sharpe loss</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="34" y="240" class="f">−√252 · mean(R) / std(R)</text>
    <text x="34" y="264" class="sub">
      <tspan data-lang-en>R = daily return of the position the net chose.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>R = lợi suất ngày của vị thế mà mạng chọn.</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="34" y="284" class="sub">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Rewards profit per unit of risk.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Thưởng cho lợi nhuận trên mỗi đơn vị rủi ro.</tspan>
    </text>

    <line x1={x0} y1={y0} x2={x0 + gw * 3 + 20} y2={y0} class="axis" />
    {[1, 2, 3].map((t) => (
      <g>
        <line x1={x0} y1={y0 - t * sy} x2={x0 + gw * 3 + 20} y2={y0 - t * sy} class="grid" />
        <text x={x0 - 8} y={y0 - t * sy + 4} text-anchor="end" class="tick">{t}</text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <text x={x0 - 8} y={y0 + 4} text-anchor="end" class="tick">0</text>
    <text x={x0 - 8} y="86" text-anchor="end" class="tick">Sharpe</text>
    <line x1={x0} y1={y0 - 0.759 * sy} x2={x0 + gw * 3 + 20} y2={y0 - 0.759 * sy} class="ref" />
    {groups.map((g, i) => (
      <g>
        <rect x={x0 + 8 + i * gw} y={y0 - g.mse * sy} width="48" height={g.mse * sy} rx="3" class="bar mse" />
        <text x={x0 + 8 + i * gw + 24} y={y0 - g.mse * sy - 6} text-anchor="middle" class="num">{g.mse.toFixed(2)}</text>
        <rect x={x0 + 64 + i * gw} y={y0 - g.sh * sy} width="48" height={g.sh * sy} rx="3" class="bar sh" />
        <text x={x0 + 64 + i * gw + 24} y={y0 - g.sh * sy - 6} text-anchor="middle" class="num">{g.sh.toFixed(2)}</text>
        <text x={x0 + 62 + i * gw} y={y0 + 22} text-anchor="middle" class="lab">
          <tspan data-lang-en>{g.en}</tspan>
          <tspan data-lang-vi>{g.vi}</tspan>
        </text>
      </g>
    ))}
    <rect x="440" y="366" width="14" height="14" class="bar mse" />
    <text x="460" y="378" class="sub">
      <tspan data-lang-en>trained on MSE</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>huấn luyện bằng MSE</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="600" y="366" width="14" height="14" class="bar sh" />
    <text x="620" y="378" class="sub">
      <tspan data-lang-en>trained on Sharpe loss</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>huấn luyện bằng Sharpe loss</tspan>
    </text>
    <line x1="440" y1="396" x2="466" y2="396" class="ref" />
    <text x="472" y="400" class="sub">
      <tspan data-lang-en>long-only 0.759</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>mua giữ 0,759</tspan>
    </text>
    <DiagramIcon name="scale" x={864} y={62} size={24} />
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Each pair is the same architecture; only the loss differs. Backtest results, rescaled to the same volatility; the paper reports the edge holds for costs up to about 2 to 3 basis points.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Mỗi cặp là cùng một kiến trúc; chỉ khác hàm loss. Kết quả backtest, quy về cùng độ biến động; bài báo ghi lợi thế còn giữ khi phí tới khoảng 2 đến 3 điểm cơ bản.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .atp14-sl { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .atp14-sl-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .atp14-sl svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .atp14-sl text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .atp14-sl .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp14-sl .sub { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp14-sl .t { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp14-sl .f { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp14-sl .lab { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp14-sl .num { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp14-sl .tick { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp14-sl .panel { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .atp14-sl .panel.good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); }
  .atp14-sl .axis { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .atp14-sl .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .atp14-sl .ref { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 4 4; }
  .atp14-sl .bar.mse { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .atp14-sl .bar.sh { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .atp14-sl figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
